		{"text"},
		line=706,
	},
	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat770010a"},
		line=706,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"As always, Miyoshi is bustling with the lively chatter of warriors.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The atmosphere is almost enough to make you forget that\nwe're living under the boot of the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, I've finished setting Table Five.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Thank you, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“You've certainly become quite proficient at this.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm already used to serving customers at the flower shop.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, please keep up the good work.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Still, though, I cannot help but feel a little guilty having you work here.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Consider it payment for my accommodations. It's the least I could do.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"The floor in my room just happened to collapse three days earlier.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san graciously allowed me to stay here in a spare room until the repairs are completed.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh my, Soujin-sama, your apron appears to be untied.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah, you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I reach to retie it, but Mutsumi-san has already circled around behind me.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Be a dear and hold still.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, I can do it myself.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Please, allow me.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Arms up now.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Feeling slightly awkward, I nonetheless do as I'm told.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Looking around the restaurant, I'm suddenly pierced by the jealous gazes of several other warriors.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"They must be among the considerable number of warriors who fancy Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“There, all done.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"She indicates with a tender pat on my back.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry for always troubling you.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Please, by no means did I intend to blame you.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san shakes her head in apology.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It is my pleasure to take care of you, and I very much enjoy doing so.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Plus, even just having you set the tables for us is a great help.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Besides Mutsumi-san herself, several other women work under her to keep the restaurant running.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Their skillful labor is like a well-oiled machine.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Just watching them makes me feel a need to make myself useful, as well.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You know, I've been thinking that I really ought to learn to cook a dish or two.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“In that case, I'd positively love to teach you sometime!”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san claps her hands together, smiling as though\nshe's come up with a delightful idea.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"At that moment, the door slides open to announce the arrival of new guests.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"It's Akari and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Akari chuckles upon seeing me in my new apron.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Welcome to Miyoshi.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's a nice look, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Could use some work in the hospitality department, though.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're one to talk.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama, Akari-sama, please come in.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san graces them with an elegant bow.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Right this way to your seats, ladies.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"As the two of them take their seats at the counter, Mutsumi-san returns to the kitchen.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're not gonna cook, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm the resident busboy and dishwasher.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All Soujin's good for is eating, y'know?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's always my breakfast in the mornings, the cafeteria for lunch, and Miyoshi for dinner.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're right. I don't think I've ever seen him cook for himself.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not like you're any different, Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll have you know I cooked for myself back in Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Akari declares with a smug grin.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“By the way, any word on the repairs in my room?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's gonna be a while longer.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But seriously, putting a hole in the floor from training too hard?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's the floor that's too weak.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The floor's the only one I feel any sympathy for.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Just how many hundreds of practice swings were you doing every night, again?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“W-Well, I suppose I could've treated the floor a little gentler...”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"With Operation Bellflower just around the corner, all I wanted was to be in my finest condition...",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama? Serve these dishes, if you please.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yes, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san pokes her head out of the kitchen and hands the dishes over.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"The small dishes are beautifully plated with shrimp and miso tofu.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"I place them down in front of the two sitting at the counter.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Appetizer's up.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, please speak to our guests with more respect.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your appetizer is served, ladies.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, that's a good boy.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Looks like someone's been house-trained.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Maybe if she keeps breaking him in like this, he'll finally learn some manners.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"The two giggle to themselves, as though I'm not standing right in front of them.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh right, Hotori. Are the preparations for Operation Bellflower coming along smoothly?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, smooth enough. Still, though...”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Hotori trails off as she sneaks a glance at Mutsumi-san.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san says nothing, returning only a smile.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nah, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"As we make our preparations for Operation Bellflower, the Sworn Blades would like all the manpower we can get our hands on.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"If Mutsumi-san and the Sarashina faction warriors at her command were to join us, it would be an enormous boon.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"But Mutsumi-san remains steadfastly unwilling to take up her blade.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, right, Mutsumi-san.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Yes?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The manager wanted me to pass on a message: 'Sorry for making you take care of Soujin-kun.'”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I do not mind in the slightest. He is helping me out, if anything.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“As far as I am concerned, I would be happy if he were to stay here forever.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, what do you say?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san asks me with a smile.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"It's hard to tell if she's serious or joking.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ahaha, I couldn't put you out that much.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Oh, what a shame.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If you were to live here, I would be able to prepare tofu for you every single day.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Y-You don't say...”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Visions of Mutsumi-san's delectable tofu dishes dance around in my head.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wipe that drool off your face, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How pathetic for a warrior to be enticed by food of all things.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I jest, of course. If I did happen to snatch Soujin-sama away, I'm sure you two would be most upset.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“L-Like I'd care about that. R-Right, Inou?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"The two of them clear their throats awkwardly.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At any rate, I'll be out of here as soon as the construction in my room is finished.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The prospect of tofu certainly was very tempting, though.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Yes, yes.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I'll be sure to put plenty of tofu in your meals moving forward.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mutsumi, I've already got Soujin's breakfast taken care of.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“In that case, I shall gladly take responsibility for his lunch.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, aren't you one lucky guy, getting yourself two homecooked meals a day.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"I'd better stop this conversation right here before it gets too far out of hand.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll pass on the lunch. I hate to make more trouble for you.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Please, it is no trouble at all.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If anything, I'd be delighted if you allowed me to pamper you more and more.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Getting to eat Mutsumi's homemade lunch every day? I\ndon't think you have a right to complain even if you got stabbed.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just look around you.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Akari turns toward the crowded restaurant at her back.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"All the onlooking warriors furtively avert their gazes.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, you're awfully popular, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, how kind of you to say.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san raises an elegant hand to her lightly flushed cheek.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To the young warriors, you're a lone flower on a lofty cliff.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Just how many poor hearts have you broken already?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“They have my deepest sympathies, but I unfortunately have no interest in affairs of the heart.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“After all, a female warrior lives only for the blade.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Women born to warrior families fall into one of two categories.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"The vast majority who do not manifest the warrior factor, and the small handful who do.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"The latter develop the same enhanced physical abilities as male warriors, though at the cost of losing their reproductive fertility.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Hence, combat-capable female warriors like Hotori, Koyuzu, and Mutsumi-san often pursue strength to the exclusion of all else.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What if you really fell in love with someone?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“If that were to happen...”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I should hope that I might have the strength to take those feelings to the grave.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san glosses over her grim declaration with an elegant smile.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Now then, my presence is needed in the kitchen, so if\nyou'll excuse me...”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, I trust that you will keep them in good company?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san heads back to the kitchen.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“For someone not interested in love, she sure is nice to you.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san is nice to everyone.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nice enough to personally pack their lunch?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I've never heard of Mutsumi-san preparing a boxed lunch for anyone.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"If that ever happened, the young warriors would be all over the rumors.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mutsumi must be really happy that Soujin's living here.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It probably reminds her of her brother.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Her brother?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He fought valiantly to the end during the war.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Akari picks up on Hotori's meaning and lowers her head in a silent prayer.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Did her brother look like Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I suppose there's some resemblance.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's leave it there. It isn't our place to pry.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"If Mutsumi-san is acting out of sentiment for her younger brother, that's fine by me.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"I don't find it unpleasant by any means, and I'm happy to act as his replacement while I'm under her care at Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"And if, hypothetically, she were to possess affection for me as a member of the opposite sex...",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Well, I'll cross that bridge when I come to it.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
